  "description": "A format-neutral vector scene for .NET: paths (move/line/quad/cubic/close), solid and gradient fills and strokes, transforms and opacity groups, plus the IPathSink a renderer replays them into. Holds no rasteriser and no font code: readers such as SharpAstro.Svg produce a scene, the caller draws it. AOT-compatible, zero dependencies.",
